{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04427","headline":"赠赵六贞固二首 二 · 陈子昂","name":"赠赵六贞固二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤螭媚其彩，婉娈苍梧泉。\n昔者琅琊子，躬耕亦慨然。\n美人岂遐旷，之子乃前贤。\n良辰在何许，白日屡颓迁。\n道心固微密，神用无留连。\n舒可弥宇宙，揽之不盈拳。\n蓬莱久芜没，金石徒精坚。\n良宝委短褐，闲琴独婵娟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}